# 后端嵌入的前端构建产物
# Keep a placeholder file so `//go:embed all:dist` always has a match in CI/lint,
# while still ignoring generated frontend build outputs.
backend/internal/web/dist/
!backend/internal/web/dist/
backend/internal/web/dist/*
!backend/internal/web/dist/.keep
# TK: the source-hash manifest is a committed input, not a build output —
# `scripts/checks/frontend-dist-freshness.py --write` produces it and
# `backend/internal/web/embed_test.go` reads it back out of the embedded FS, so it
# must survive a fresh clone. It was tracked while this rule shadowed it.
!backend/internal/web/dist/frontend-source.json

